  "processing": "gain only"
 },
 "file": "episodes/ep001/review-c4/narration.m4a (AAC 96 kbps mono 48 kHz)",
 "events": [
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 1,
   "sequence": 0,
   "scene": "S01",
   "start_s": 0.5,
   "end_s": 10.82,
   "text": "In February 2026, the average 30-year fixed mortgage rate in the US fell to 5.98 percent, the lowest since September 2022."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 10.82,
   "end_s": 11.27,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 2,
   "sequence": 0,
   "scene": "S01",
   "start_s": 11.27,
   "end_s": 15.71,
   "text": "Nora had borrowed in 2023, at 7.62 percent."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 15.71,
   "end_s": 16.16,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 3
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 3,
   "sequence": 0,
   "scene": "S01",
   "start_s": 16.16,
   "end_s": 21.44,
   "text": "At the February rate, a new loan would have cut her payment by $459 a month."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "beat",
   "start_s": 21.44,
   "end_s": 22.44,
   "dur_s": 1.0,
   "before_n": 4
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 4,
   "sequence": 0,
   "scene": "S01",
   "start_s": 22.44,
   "end_s": 23.27,
   "text": "She didn't take it."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "beat",
   "start_s": 23.27,
   "end_s": 24.27,
   "dur_s": 1.0,
   "before_n": 5
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 5,
   "sequence": 0,
   "scene": "S01",
   "start_s": 24.27,
   "end_s": 30.72,
   "text": "By late September, the rate was back above 7 percent, for the first time since January 2025."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "scene",
   "start_s": 30.72,
   "end_s": 32.12,
   "dur_s": 1.4,
   "before_n": 6
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 6,
   "sequence": 0,
   "scene": "S02",
   "start_s": 32.12,
   "end_s": 44.06,
   "text": "Now a letter comes from her lender: an offer to refinance, a new loan at a slightly lower rate that pays off the old one, for $5,124 in fees."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 44.06,
   "end_s": 44.51,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 7
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 7,
   "sequence": 0,
   "scene": "S02",
   "start_s": 44.51,
   "end_s": 50.99,
   "text": "How big a rate cut makes that worth it for Nora — and where does a loan your size fall?"
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "beat",
   "start_s": 50.99,
   "end_s": 51.99,
   "dur_s": 1.0,
   "before_n": 8
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 8,
   "sequence": 0,
   "scene": "S02",
   "start_s": 51.99,
   "end_s": 54.89,
   "text": "And why would a smaller mortgage need a bigger cut?"
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "sequence",
   "start_s": 54.89,
   "end_s": 56.89,
   "dur_s": 2.0,
   "before_n": 9
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 9,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S03",
   "start_s": 56.89,
   "end_s": 65.27,
   "text": "Nora borrowed in October 2023, the month the average rate reached 7.79 percent, its highest since 2000."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 65.27,
   "end_s": 65.72,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 10
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 10,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S03",
   "start_s": 65.72,
   "end_s": 74.36,
   "text": "She was far from alone: three in ten of that year's 30-year loans to buy a home carried a rate of 7 percent or more."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "scene",
   "start_s": 74.36,
   "end_s": 75.76,
   "dur_s": 1.4,
   "before_n": 11
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 11,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S04",
   "start_s": 75.76,
   "end_s": 82.07,
   "text": "Nora isn't a real person; we built her from typical figures, to show how the math works for one household."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 82.07,
   "end_s": 82.52,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 12
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 12,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S04",
   "start_s": 82.52,
   "end_s": 93.48,
   "text": "She had moved for a new job and bought her first home, with a $375,000 loan at 7.62 percent, the average rate that month."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 93.48,
   "end_s": 93.93,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 13
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 13,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S04",
   "start_s": 93.93,
   "end_s": 98.66,
   "text": "Every dollar amount in this story is in the dollars of the day, not adjusted for inflation."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "scene",
   "start_s": 98.66,
   "end_s": 100.06,
   "dur_s": 1.4,
   "before_n": 14
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 14,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S05",
   "start_s": 100.06,
   "end_s": 105.72,
   "text": "You may have heard that a refinance only pays off once rates fall a full percentage point below yours."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 105.72,
   "end_s": 106.17,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 15
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 15,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S05",
   "start_s": 106.17,
   "end_s": 108.59,
   "text": "We use that one-point line as a test."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 108.59,
   "end_s": 109.04,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 16
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 16,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S05",
   "start_s": 109.04,
   "end_s": 112.48,
   "text": "And for Nora, rates did cross that line."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 112.48,
   "end_s": 112.93,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 17
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 17,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S05",
   "start_s": 112.93,
   "end_s": 118.52,
   "text": "In 2026, the average spent 29 weeks at least a full point below her rate."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 118.52,
   "end_s": 118.97,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 18
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 18,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S05",
   "start_s": 118.97,
   "end_s": 123.5,
   "text": "At the February low, the gap was 1.64 points."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 123.5,
   "end_s": 123.95,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 19
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 19,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S05",
   "start_s": 123.95,
   "end_s": 131.71,
   "text": "After the week ending July 23, 2026, the gap never again reached a full point, and the window closed."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "beat",
   "start_s": 131.71,
   "end_s": 132.71,
   "dur_s": 1.0,
   "before_n": 20
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 20,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S05",
   "start_s": 132.71,
   "end_s": 141.18,
   "text": "Whether it opens again, we can't tell you: everything in this story is history, not a forecast, and it covers the US only."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "scene",
   "start_s": 141.18,
   "end_s": 142.58,
   "dur_s": 1.4,
   "before_n": 21
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 21,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S06",
   "start_s": 142.58,
   "end_s": 145.42,
   "text": "So the letter arrives in a different world."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 145.42,
   "end_s": 145.87,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 22
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 22,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S06",
   "start_s": 145.87,
   "end_s": 154.35,
   "text": "Say the rate it offers matches the national average for the week ending September 24, 2026: 7.03 percent."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 154.35,
   "end_s": 154.8,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 23
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 23,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S06",
   "start_s": 154.8,
   "end_s": 158.58,
   "text": "That is just over half a percentage point below what she pays now."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 158.58,
   "end_s": 159.03,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 24
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 24,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S06",
   "start_s": 159.03,
   "end_s": 164.64,
   "text": "From here on, when we say a point, we mean exactly that: one percentage point off the rate."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 164.64,
   "end_s": 165.09,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 25
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 25,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S06",
   "start_s": 165.09,
   "end_s": 169.43,
   "text": "Her monthly payment would drop by $221."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "scene",
   "start_s": 169.43,
   "end_s": 170.83,
   "dur_s": 1.4,
   "before_n": 26
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 26,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S07",
   "start_s": 170.83,
   "end_s": 172.61,
   "text": "Then comes the last line."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 172.61,
   "end_s": 173.06,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 27
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 27,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S07",
   "start_s": 173.06,
   "end_s": 184.58,
   "text": "$5,124 in loan costs, paid in cash at closing: the lender's charges for making the loan, plus anything she pays up front to buy the rate down."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 184.58,
   "end_s": 185.03,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 28
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 28,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S07",
   "start_s": 185.03,
   "end_s": 187.22,
   "text": "That bill is not made up."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 187.22,
   "end_s": 187.67,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 29
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 29,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S07",
   "start_s": 187.67,
   "end_s": 195.03,
   "text": "It is the median from nearly half a million refinances in 2025, and her loan size is the median too."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 195.03,
   "end_s": 195.48,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 30
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 30,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S07",
   "start_s": 195.48,
   "end_s": 198.82,
   "text": "If a letter like this has reached you, this is the math behind it."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "scene",
   "start_s": 198.82,
   "end_s": 200.22,
   "dur_s": 1.4,
   "before_n": 31
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 31,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S08",
   "start_s": 200.22,
   "end_s": 201.26,
   "text": "Is it worth paying?"
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 201.26,
   "end_s": 201.71,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 32
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 32,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S08",
   "start_s": 201.71,
   "end_s": 208.13,
   "text": "Worth it, here, means one thing: the savings pay back the fees before she sells or moves."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 208.13,
   "end_s": 208.58,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 33
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 33,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S08",
   "start_s": 208.58,
   "end_s": 212.45,
   "text": "We test a stay of three years, a choice we made, not a rule."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 212.45,
   "end_s": 212.9,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 34
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 34,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S08",
   "start_s": 212.9,
   "end_s": 214.27,
   "text": "There are two quick answers."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 214.27,
   "end_s": 214.72,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 35
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 35,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S08",
   "start_s": 214.72,
   "end_s": 216.97,
   "text": "The one-point line says no."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 216.97,
   "end_s": 217.42,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 36
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 36,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S08",
   "start_s": 217.42,
   "end_s": 219.07,
   "text": "Her cut falls short."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 219.07,
   "end_s": 219.52,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 37
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 37,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S08",
   "start_s": 219.52,
   "end_s": 231.04,
   "text": "Simple division says yes: $5,124 divided by $221 is about 24 months."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "beat",
   "start_s": 231.04,
   "end_s": 232.04,
   "dur_s": 1.0,
   "before_n": 38
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 38,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S08",
   "start_s": 232.04,
   "end_s": 233.36,
   "text": "Neither is quite right."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 233.36,
   "end_s": 233.81,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 39
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 39,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S08",
   "start_s": 233.81,
   "end_s": 236.78,
   "text": "The one-point line never looks at the bill."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 236.78,
   "end_s": 237.23,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 40
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 40,
   "sequence": 1,
   "scene": "S08",
   "start_s": 237.23,
   "end_s": 239.87,
   "text": "And the division leaves something out."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "sequence",
   "start_s": 239.87,
   "end_s": 241.87,
   "dur_s": 2.0,
   "before_n": 41
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 41,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S09",
   "start_s": 241.87,
   "end_s": 242.78,
   "text": "Back to the letter."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 242.78,
   "end_s": 243.23,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 42
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 42,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S09",
   "start_s": 243.23,
   "end_s": 246.94,
   "text": "Break-even is the month when what she has saved covers the bill."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 246.94,
   "end_s": 247.39,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 43
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 43,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S09",
   "start_s": 247.39,
   "end_s": 252.83,
   "text": "Division stacks up $221 a month and stops at month 24."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 252.83,
   "end_s": 253.28,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 44
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 44,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S09",
   "start_s": 253.28,
   "end_s": 257.76,
   "text": "But while the savings stack up, something else is happening, to what she still owes."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "scene",
   "start_s": 257.76,
   "end_s": 259.16,
   "dur_s": 1.4,
   "before_n": 45
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 45,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S10",
   "start_s": 259.16,
   "end_s": 263.76,
   "text": "Nora has made 35 payments on her old loan, one a month since she moved in."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 263.76,
   "end_s": 264.21,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 46
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 46,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S10",
   "start_s": 264.21,
   "end_s": 268.29,
   "text": "With each one, a little more goes to paying down what she owes."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 268.29,
   "end_s": 268.74,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 47
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 47,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S10",
   "start_s": 268.74,
   "end_s": 275.88,
   "text": "A refinance starts a fresh 30-year clock, and in the early years of any mortgage, most of each payment goes to interest."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 275.88,
   "end_s": 276.33,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 48
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 48,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S10",
   "start_s": 276.33,
   "end_s": 280.36,
   "text": "So the new loan pays down her balance more slowly than the old one would have."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 280.36,
   "end_s": 280.81,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 49
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 49,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S10",
   "start_s": 280.81,
   "end_s": 288.8,
   "text": "By month 24, she owes $1,133 more than if she had kept the old loan."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "beat",
   "start_s": 288.8,
   "end_s": 289.8,
   "dur_s": 1.0,
   "before_n": 50
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 50,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S10",
   "start_s": 289.8,
   "end_s": 297.69,
   "text": "If she sold the house then, that $1,133 would come out of her sale money, so it cancels part of what she has saved."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 297.69,
   "end_s": 298.14,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 51
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 51,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S10",
   "start_s": 298.14,
   "end_s": 303.29,
   "text": "Her savings need a few more months to cover it, and the gap keeps growing a little while they do."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 303.29,
   "end_s": 303.74,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 52
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 52,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S10",
   "start_s": 303.74,
   "end_s": 307.48,
   "text": "Count it, and break-even moves from month 24 to month 30."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "scene",
   "start_s": 307.48,
   "end_s": 308.88,
   "dur_s": 1.4,
   "before_n": 53
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 53,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S11",
   "start_s": 308.88,
   "end_s": 311.95,
   "text": "The smaller the cut, the more that gap matters."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 311.95,
   "end_s": 312.4,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 54
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 54,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S11",
   "start_s": 312.4,
   "end_s": 315.52,
   "text": "Suppose her offer were only a quarter of a point."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 315.52,
   "end_s": 315.97,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 55
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 55,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S11",
   "start_s": 315.97,
   "end_s": 319.19,
   "text": "Division promises break-even in 38 months."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 319.19,
   "end_s": 319.64,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 56
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 56,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S11",
   "start_s": 319.64,
   "end_s": 323.99,
   "text": "But a saving that small can't outrun the growing gap in what she owes."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 323.99,
   "end_s": 324.44,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 57
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 57,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S11",
   "start_s": 324.44,
   "end_s": 329.29,
   "text": "Counting it, the fees never come back, not in all the years her old loan had left."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "scene",
   "start_s": 329.29,
   "end_s": 330.69,
   "dur_s": 1.4,
   "before_n": 58
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 58,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S12",
   "start_s": 330.69,
   "end_s": 335.32,
   "text": "At a full point, she would break even in 18 months, well inside three years."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "scene",
   "start_s": 335.32,
   "end_s": 336.72,
   "dur_s": 1.4,
   "before_n": 59
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 59,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S13",
   "start_s": 336.72,
   "end_s": 339.92,
   "text": "Somewhere between a quarter point and a full point is her line."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 339.92,
   "end_s": 340.37,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 60
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 60,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S13",
   "start_s": 340.37,
   "end_s": 344.41,
   "text": "At half a point, the fees come back in exactly 36 months."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "beat",
   "start_s": 344.41,
   "end_s": 345.41,
   "dur_s": 1.0,
   "before_n": 61
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 61,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S13",
   "start_s": 345.41,
   "end_s": 350.43,
   "text": "So for Nora, the answer is half a point, half of the one-point line."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 350.43,
   "end_s": 350.88,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 62
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 62,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S13",
   "start_s": 350.88,
   "end_s": 354.31,
   "text": "Her real offer, just over half a point, clears it."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 354.31,
   "end_s": 354.76,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 63
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 63,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S13",
   "start_s": 354.76,
   "end_s": 360.35,
   "text": "The February window closed, but by the three-year test, this letter still pays her back."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "beat",
   "start_s": 360.35,
   "end_s": 361.35,
   "dur_s": 1.0,
   "before_n": 64
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 64,
   "sequence": 2,
   "scene": "S13",
   "start_s": 361.35,
   "end_s": 363.27,
   "text": "Is half a point the line for everyone?"
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "sequence",
   "start_s": 363.27,
   "end_s": 365.27,
   "dur_s": 2.0,
   "before_n": 65
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 65,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S14",
   "start_s": 365.27,
   "end_s": 368.35,
   "text": "Walt is another borrower we built from typical figures."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 368.35,
   "end_s": 368.8,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 66
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 66,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S14",
   "start_s": 368.8,
   "end_s": 374.84,
   "text": "He bought a smaller house the same month as Nora, with a $115,000 loan at the same rate."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 374.84,
   "end_s": 375.29,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 67
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 67,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S14",
   "start_s": 375.29,
   "end_s": 377.44,
   "text": "His letter offers the same cut."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 377.44,
   "end_s": 377.89,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 68
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 68,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S14",
   "start_s": 377.89,
   "end_s": 383.39,
   "text": "The bill at the bottom: $3,667."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "beat",
   "start_s": 383.39,
   "end_s": 384.39,
   "dur_s": 1.0,
   "before_n": 69
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 69,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S14",
   "start_s": 384.39,
   "end_s": 386.61,
   "text": "His loan is far smaller than hers."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 386.61,
   "end_s": 387.06,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 70
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 70,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S14",
   "start_s": 387.06,
   "end_s": 389.44,
   "text": "His bill is only a little smaller."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "scene",
   "start_s": 389.44,
   "end_s": 390.84,
   "dur_s": 1.4,
   "before_n": 71
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 71,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S15",
   "start_s": 390.84,
   "end_s": 396.18,
   "text": "In the 2025 data, refinance bills grow far more slowly than the loans they come with."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 396.18,
   "end_s": 396.63,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 72
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 72,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S15",
   "start_s": 396.63,
   "end_s": 400.07,
   "text": "For Walt, it comes to about 3.2 percent of what he borrowed."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 400.07,
   "end_s": 400.52,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 73
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 73,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S15",
   "start_s": 400.52,
   "end_s": 402.81,
   "text": "His savings, though, shrink with the loan."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 402.81,
   "end_s": 403.26,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 74
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 74,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S15",
   "start_s": 403.26,
   "end_s": 406.75,
   "text": "The same cut takes only $68 a month off his payment."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "beat",
   "start_s": 406.75,
   "end_s": 407.75,
   "dur_s": 1.0,
   "before_n": 75
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 75,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S15",
   "start_s": 407.75,
   "end_s": 413.51,
   "text": "$68 a month, against a $3,667 bill."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 413.51,
   "end_s": 413.96,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 76
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 76,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S15",
   "start_s": 413.96,
   "end_s": 417.28,
   "text": "Counting what he owes, he breaks even in month 75."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "scene",
   "start_s": 417.28,
   "end_s": 418.68,
   "dur_s": 1.4,
   "before_n": 77
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 77,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S16",
   "start_s": 418.68,
   "end_s": 425.07,
   "text": "If Walt sold after three years, he would come out $1,777 behind."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 425.07,
   "end_s": 425.52,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 78
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 78,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S16",
   "start_s": 425.52,
   "end_s": 432.44,
   "text": "For his fees to come back within three years, his rate would need to fall 1.12 points."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 432.44,
   "end_s": 432.89,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 79
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 79,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S16",
   "start_s": 432.89,
   "end_s": 435.21,
   "text": "That is more than the one-point line."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "beat",
   "start_s": 435.21,
   "end_s": 436.21,
   "dur_s": 1.0,
   "before_n": 80
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 80,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S16",
   "start_s": 436.21,
   "end_s": 439.34,
   "text": "So that is why a smaller mortgage needs a bigger rate cut."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 439.34,
   "end_s": 439.79,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 81
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 81,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S16",
   "start_s": 439.79,
   "end_s": 444.41,
   "text": "The fees barely shrink with the loan, and the monthly savings shrink right along with it."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "scene",
   "start_s": 444.41,
   "end_s": 445.81,
   "dur_s": 1.4,
   "before_n": 82
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 82,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S17",
   "start_s": 445.81,
   "end_s": 447.35,
   "text": "Anjali sits at the other end."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 447.35,
   "end_s": 447.8,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 83
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 83,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S17",
   "start_s": 447.8,
   "end_s": 450.74,
   "text": "Same month, same rate, same cut."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 450.74,
   "end_s": 451.19,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 84
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 84,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S17",
   "start_s": 451.19,
   "end_s": 462.22,
   "text": "She bought a bigger house, with a $655,000 loan, still under the conforming limit: the ceiling for the standard loans that Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac buy."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 462.22,
   "end_s": 462.67,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 85
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 85,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S17",
   "start_s": 462.67,
   "end_s": 468.36,
   "text": "Her bill is $5,514, close to what Nora pays."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 468.36,
   "end_s": 468.81,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 86
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 86,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S17",
   "start_s": 468.81,
   "end_s": 474.62,
   "text": "If she sold after three years, she would come out $5,250 ahead."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 474.62,
   "end_s": 475.07,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 87
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 87,
   "sequence": 3,
   "scene": "S17",
   "start_s": 475.07,
   "end_s": 479.93,
   "text": "To get her fees back within three years, she needs a cut of only about a third of a point."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "sequence",
   "start_s": 479.93,
   "end_s": 481.93,
   "dur_s": 2.0,
   "before_n": 88
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 88,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S18",
   "start_s": 481.93,
   "end_s": 485.17,
   "text": "So, back to the letter, and the question it started with."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 485.17,
   "end_s": 485.62,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 89
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 89,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S18",
   "start_s": 485.62,
   "end_s": 491.59,
   "text": "How big a rate cut makes a refinance worth it, if worth it means the fees come back within three years?"
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 491.59,
   "end_s": 492.04,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 90
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 90,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S18",
   "start_s": 492.04,
   "end_s": 493.85,
   "text": "It depends on the size of the loan."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 493.85,
   "end_s": 494.3,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 91
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 91,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S18",
   "start_s": 494.3,
   "end_s": 499.65,
   "text": "On a loan of $115,000, like Walt's, it takes more than a full point."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 499.65,
   "end_s": 500.1,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 92
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 92,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S18",
   "start_s": 500.1,
   "end_s": 504.15,
   "text": "On $375,000, like Nora's, half a point."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 504.15,
   "end_s": 504.6,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 93
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 93,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S18",
   "start_s": 504.6,
   "end_s": 509.47,
   "text": "On $655,000, like Anjali's, about a third of a point."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "beat",
   "start_s": 509.47,
   "end_s": 510.47,
   "dur_s": 1.0,
   "before_n": 94
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 94,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S18",
   "start_s": 510.47,
   "end_s": 514.1,
   "text": "Put your own loan on that scale, and you can see which of them you are closest to."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 514.1,
   "end_s": 514.55,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 95
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 95,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S18",
   "start_s": 514.55,
   "end_s": 522.67,
   "text": "Those lines rest on our assumptions: a loan taken out at the October 2023 rate, a median bill, and a three-year stay."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 522.67,
   "end_s": 523.12,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 96
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 96,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S18",
   "start_s": 523.12,
   "end_s": 526.02,
   "text": "The one-point line fits none of them."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "scene",
   "start_s": 526.02,
   "end_s": 527.42,
   "dur_s": 1.4,
   "before_n": 97
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 97,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S19",
   "start_s": 527.42,
   "end_s": 532.03,
   "text": "These are national average rates, median bills, and three made-up borrowers."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 532.03,
   "end_s": 532.48,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 98
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 98,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S19",
   "start_s": 532.48,
   "end_s": 541.01,
   "text": "In 2025, half of refinance bills fell between $3,443 and $8,270."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
   "start_s": 541.01,
   "end_s": 541.46,
   "dur_s": 0.45,
   "before_n": 99
  },
  {
   "type": "sentence",
   "n": 99,
   "sequence": 4,
   "scene": "S19",
   "start_s": 541.46,
   "end_s": 545.65,
   "text": "A real rate, a real bill and a real balance will be different."
  },
  {
   "type": "pause",
   "kind": "same",
